source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The killed italic opener leaves every underscore literal inside a bold that still closes; jiro reads one bold effect whose content is plain text.
-- input.jira --
*x _a_b_ y*
-- rendered.html --
<p><b>x _a_b_ y</b></p>
-- want.md --
**x \_a\_b\_ y**
-- warnings.json --
[]
